Description: Your work desktops on COSMIC (unofficial)
 Deskfeed lists the desktops your organization gives you in Azure Virtual
 Desktop and Windows 365, and connects to them, or to your own Windows
 machines, through FreeRDP. Made for the COSMIC desktop.
 .
 Unofficial community app; it is not a Microsoft product.
